  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.4. Strengthened social dialogue and labour relations laws, processes and institutions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">National tripartite Commission for Consultation and Collective Bargaining (NTCCCB) has been reactivated to discuss post Covid -19 recovery strategy 

Two new Territorial Commissions for Consultations and Collective Bargaining established. With RBSA support, the ILO assisted the Tripartite Standing Committee on labour legislation, employment and social protection (TSCLESP) of the National tripartite Commission for Consultation and Collective Bargaining (NTCCCB) in evaluating Covid-19 measures implemented by the Government and putting forward evidence&#x2013;based recovery recommendations for discussion in the NTCCCB.

The ILO provided logistic and technical support in the setting up process, advocacy and awareness raising at the local level on the role of social dialogue in local labor market governance.</narrative>
   </description>
